<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - En Pointe raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - En Pointe raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Boston Group raised its recommendation on En Pointe Technologies to strong buy from buy based on the strength of its earnings and revenues compared with its peers, favorable market trends and the sucess of its propietary software.</p>
<p>--raised Q4 1996 EPS estimates to $0.21 from $0.13.</p>
<p>--raised FY1996 EPS estimates to $0.70 from $0.58.</p>
<p>--raised FY1997 EPS estimates to $0.90 from $0.72.</p>
<p>--set a six-month price target of $15-17 a share and a 12-month target of above $20 a share.</p>
</text>
